    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "PROPERTY AT A GLANCE !!!!\r\n###DUPLEX APARTMENT ###\r\n###NEW KITCHEN #####\r\n###PARKING#####\r\n###UPGRADES THROUGHOUT ####\r\n####SOUTHWEST FACING BALCONY ####\r\n###SERVICE CHARGE 2026 INCLUDING SINKING FUND APPROX €1730###\r\n\r\nEarnest are delighted to present Apartment 21 Tir Connell Grove to the market. This well-presented two-bedroom duplex apartment is situated on the second floor of this popular development and benefits from a highly desirable south-west facing aspect, a private balcony and a designated car parking space.\r\n\r\nThe property has recently undergone a number of upgrades, including a new contemporary kitchen, new laminate flooring in the living area, fresh internal decoration and minor upgrades to the bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall leading into a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area, which benefits from excellent natural light and direct access to the balcony. The newly fitted kitchen is positioned off the living area and provides a modern and practical space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two well-proportioned double bedrooms, both featuring built-in wardrobes, carpeting and excellent natural light due to the property's south-west orientation. The main bathroom has also been upgraded and includes new flooring , mirror with lighting and a new shower screen.\r\n\r\nThe property is further enhanced by its generous room proportions, excellent natural light, south-west facing aspect, private balcony and designated parking space.\r\n\r\nConveniently located within a short stroll of the vibrant Inchicore Village with all amenities close by including schools and St James hospital. Tesco\\'s express , shops and restaurants are all at your doorstep. Located just off Emmet road the apartment is well served by transport links including Goldenbridge Luas stop, and a busy Bus corridor passes by the development on both Emmet rd and Tyrconnel road. Surrounding areas include Kilmainham and Rialto while the city centre is a short drive away !"
      },
